ed":49,"skipped":50},"spustil se","už načteno","neodpovídá",{"title":52,"lead":53,"key":54,"note":55},"Záložní jazyk","Klíč, který aktivní jazyk nemá, se vyhodnotí přes fallbackLocale, místo aby zůstal prázdný.","Klíč","Zálohují se jen chybějící klíče. Co vykreslí klíč chybějící všude, určuje fallbackValue.",{"site.tagline":57,"nav.docs":58,"nav.playground":59,"nav.github":6,"nav.language":60,"lang.en":8,"lang.cs":9,"lang.de":10,"banner.v3":61,"error.title":62,"error.404":63,"error.default":64,"error.home":65,"playground":66},"Internationalization for SvelteKit","Documentation","Playground","Language","This is the documentation for v3. For the v2 line, see the {{branch}} branch.","Something went wrong","This page does not exist.","An unexpected error occurred.","Back to the homepage",{"title":59,"lead":67,"source":68,"output":69,"parser":70,"preprocess":79,"loaders":84,"fallback":98},"Every panel below drives a real instance through the public API. Change an input and the library answers — nothing here is a recording.","Show the code","Output",{"title":71,"lead":72,"format":73,"flavour":74,"message":75,"payload":76,"locale":77,"silent":78},"Message formats","The core holds no message format of its own: a parser fills the slot. Curly comes with this package; ICU is the alternative, on the core directly.","Message format",{"curly":25,"icu":26},"Message","Payload","Locale","No reports. A report never raises — the placeholder takes its fallback and the rest of the message resolves.",{"title":80,"lead":81,"input":82,"note":83},"Preprocessing","Nested translations become the flat keys t() reads. The mode decides how far that goes.","Translations","rawTranslations keeps the input as it arrived; translations is what you see here.",{"title":85,"lead":86,"locale":77,"route":38,"load":87,"invalidate":88,"reset":41,"empty":89,"shape":90,"status":94},"Loaders","A loader runs when its locale matches and its routes match the current route, once per freshness window. Load the same 